    "type": "game",
    "name": "Cards of Prophecy",
    "steam_appid": 3256450,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256450/extras/426887ba438fa2494393a9c987a9afdc.avif?t=1755229804\" data-has-big width=800 height=621 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cards of Prophecy</strong> combines Tower Defense, Deckbuilding, and Roguelike elements, with huge inspiration from Trading Card Games.  <br>Build an ever evolving deck of spells and monsters. Fuse, defend, open card packs, create new strategies. Repeat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Use your cards to summon incredible monsters and use powerful spells!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256450/extras/920c0c2812ef16eb05ab75532c3f1281.poster.avif?t=1755229804\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256450/extras/920c0c2812ef16eb05ab75532c3f1281.webm?t=1755229804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256450/extras/920c0c2812ef16eb05ab75532c3f1281.mp4?t=1755229804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your deck as you go, and discover strategies along the way. Every monster is special in their own way\u2013learn to master them and use them wisely!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your spells carefully! They may not be monsters, but that doesn't mean they aren't powerful.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each map is randomly generated and every round brings new challenges. Make sure to play strategically!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fuse your cards into brand new monsters!</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256450/extras/4f4d32ad18b79196bb1f4f26982a9f60.poster.avif?t=1755229804\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256450/extras/4f4d32ad18b79196bb1f4f26982a9f60.webm?t=1755229804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256450/extras/4f4d32ad18b79196bb1f4f26982a9f60.mp4?t=1755229804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the &quot;Fusion&quot; spell card, you'll be able to fuse two monsters into a brand new monster with incredibly powerful effects!\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Open a brand new pack of cards after each run! A whole collection of cards awaits!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256450/extras/1ec4a3fd6a87048ac96ec86bab774a46.poster.avif?t=1755229804\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256450/extras/1ec4a3fd6a87048ac96ec86bab774a46.webm?t=1755229804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256450/extras/1ec4a3fd6a87048ac96ec86bab774a46.mp4?t=1755229804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each run, you'll earn gold to buy some brand new pack of cards, who knows what's inside? There might be some surprises...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are more than 100 cards to discover, each one will help you achieve victory in a different way!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Make a friend along the way</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256450/extras/b335c3a1c5dd53fb0e2bd7aeae394e9b.poster.avif?t=1755229804\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256450/extras/b335c3a1c5dd53fb0e2bd7aeae394e9b.webm?t=1755229804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256450/extras/b335c3a1c5dd53fb0e2bd7aeae394e9b.mp4?t=1755229804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your little dog, Charly, will be with you on your adventures. Isn't he super cute?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every game mode has a different skin of your cute friend, which also has an unique Music according to him!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256450/extras/426887ba438fa2494393a9c987a9afdc.avif?t=1755229804\" data-has-big width=800 height=621 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cards of Prophecy</strong> combines Tower Defense, Deckbuilding, and Roguelike elements, with huge inspiration from Trading Card Games.  <br>Build an ever evolving deck of spells and monsters. Fuse, defend, open card packs, create new strategies. Repeat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Use your cards to summon incredible monsters and use powerful spells!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256450/extras/920c0c2812ef16eb05ab75532c3f1281.poster.avif?t=1755229804\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256450/extras/920c0c2812ef16eb05ab75532c3f1281.webm?t=1755229804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256450/extras/920c0c2812ef16eb05ab75532c3f1281.mp4?t=1755229804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your deck as you go, and discover strategies along the way. Every monster is special in their own way\u2013learn to master them and use them wisely!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your spells carefully! They may not be monsters, but that doesn't mean they aren't powerful.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each map is randomly generated and every round brings new challenges. Make sure to play strategically!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fuse your cards into brand new monsters!</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256450/extras/4f4d32ad18b79196bb1f4f26982a9f60.poster.avif?t=1755229804\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256450/extras/4f4d32ad18b79196bb1f4f26982a9f60.webm?t=1755229804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256450/extras/4f4d32ad18b79196bb1f4f26982a9f60.mp4?t=1755229804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the &quot;Fusion&quot; spell card, you'll be able to fuse two monsters into a brand new monster with incredibly powerful effects!\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Open a brand new pack of cards after each run! A whole collection of cards awaits!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256450/extras/1ec4a3fd6a87048ac96ec86bab774a46.poster.avif?t=1755229804\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256450/extras/1ec4a3fd6a87048ac96ec86bab774a46.webm?t=1755229804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256450/extras/1ec4a3fd6a87048ac96ec86bab774a46.mp4?t=1755229804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each run, you'll earn gold to buy some brand new pack of cards, who knows what's inside? There might be some surprises...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are more than 100 cards to discover, each one will help you achieve victory in a different way!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Make a friend along the way</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256450/extras/b335c3a1c5dd53fb0e2bd7aeae394e9b.poster.avif?t=1755229804\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256450/extras/b335c3a1c5dd53fb0e2bd7aeae394e9b.webm?t=1755229804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256450/extras/b335c3a1c5dd53fb0e2bd7aeae394e9b.mp4?t=1755229804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your little dog, Charly, will be with you on your adventures. Isn't he super cute?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every game mode has a different skin of your cute friend, which also has an unique Music according to him!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
